	(descr "Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and Choc V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, hot-swap socket, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.3=13.95mm square (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 2.00u (courtyard 38.05x19.00mm). No stabilizer PCB features. For Kailh Choc 1350 (V1) stabilizers use the _ChocV1Stab variant. For Kailh Choc V2 stabilizers use the _ChocV2Stab variant.")
